  <!--
    Single master changelog for ALL environments (Liquibase Re-Enablement Plan
    2026-07-04, package L1). Replaces the former per-environment masters
    (userservice-{local,dev,staging,prod,testing}-master.xml).

    Rules:
    - Changeset identity = id + author + file path. NEVER move or rename the
      included changeset files; only append new includes at the bottom.
    - Environment differences are expressed via Liquibase contexts, not via
      separate masters. Seed/demo data changesets must carry context="seed".
      Runtime contexts: local/dev pass "local,seed" / "dev,seed"; staging/prod
      pass "staging" / "prod" (an explicit context is required, because a
      changeset WITH a context still runs when NO runtime context is given).
    - Schema changesets are unconditional (no context) and must be additive
      (nullable columns) with preconditions (onFail="MARK_RAN") so they are
      safe on databases that already received the change manually.
  -->

